{"id":"nave:solomon","source":"nave","name":"Solomon","slug":"solomon","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Son of David by Bath-sheba 2Sa 12:24; 1Ki 1:13,17,21","refs":[["2Sam",12,24,12,24],["1Kgs",1,13,1,13],["1Kgs",1,17,1,17],["1Kgs",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"Named Jedidiah, by Nathan the prophet 2Sa 12:24,25","refs":[["2Sam",12,24,12,24],["2Sam",12,25,12,25]]},{"text":"An ancestor of Joseph Mt 1:6","refs":[["Matt",1,6,1,6]]},{"text":"Succeeds David to the throne of Israel 1Ki 1:11-48; 2:12; 1Ch 23:1; 28; Ec 1:12","refs":[["1Kgs",1,11,1,48],["1Kgs",2,12,2,12],["1Chr",23,1,23,1],["1Chr",28,0,28,0],["Eccl",1,12,1,12]]},{"text":"Anointed king a second time 1Ch 29:22","refs":[["1Chr",29,22,29,22]]},{"text":"His prayer for wisdom, and his vision 1Ki 3:5-14; 2Ch 1:7-12","refs":[["1Kgs",3,5,3,14],["2Chr",1,7,1,12]]},{"text":"Covenant renewed in a vision after the dedication of the temple 1Ki 9:1-9; 2Ch 7:12-22","refs":[["1Kgs",9,1,9,9],["2Chr",7,12,7,22]]},{"text":"His rigorous reign 1Ki 2","refs":[["1Kgs",2,0,2,0]]},{"text":"Builds the temple 1Ki 5; 6; 9:10; 1Ch 6:10; 2Ch 2; 3; 4; 7:11; Jer 52:20; Ac 7","refs":[["1Kgs",5,0,5,0],["1Kgs",6,0,6,0],["1Kgs",9,10,9,10],["1Chr",6,10,6,10],["2Chr",2,0,2,0],["2Chr",3,0,3,0],["2Chr",4,0,4,0],["2Chr",7,11,7,11],["Jer",52,20,52,20],["Acts",7,0,7,0]]},{"text":"Dedicates the temple 1Ki 8; 2Ch 6","refs":[["1Kgs",8,0,8,0],["2Chr",6,0,6,0]]},{"text":"Renews the courses of the priests and Levites, and the forms of service according to the commandment of Moses and the regulations of David 2Ch 8:12-16; 35:4; Ne 12:45","refs":[["2Chr",8,12,8,16],["2Chr",35,4,35,4],["Neh",12,45,12,45]]},{"text":"Builds his palace 1Ki 3:1; 7:1,8; 9:10; 2Ch 7:11; 8:1; Ec 2:4","refs":[["1Kgs",3,1,3,1],["1Kgs",7,1,7,1],["1Kgs",7,8,7,8],["1Kgs",9,10,9,10],["2Chr",7,11,7,11],["2Chr",8,1,8,1],["Eccl",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Builds his house, The Forest of Lebanon 1Ki 7:2-7","refs":[["1Kgs",7,2,7,7]]},{"text":"Builds another house for Pharaoh’ s daughter 1Ki 7:8-12; 9:24; 2Ch 